This repository provides code and configuration files for reproducing the
experiments associated with the manuscript "Stage-Aware Spatial-Temporal
Granularity Learning for Efficient Skeleton-Based Action Recognition".

The datasets used by this project, including NTU RGB+D 60 and
Kinetics-Skeleton, are not distributed with this repository. Users must obtain
the datasets from their official sources and comply with their respective
licenses and terms of use.

Pretrained model weights, if provided separately, may be subject to additional
terms specified in the corresponding release notes.

